.DS_Store
npm-debug.log*

# Runtime logs written under the DEFAULT personal profile. The token log stores a
# 120-character raw preview of every tool call's arguments (summarizeArgs), and the
# cache snapshot stores raw argsKeys -- neither belongs in a public repository.
# Only SERVER_PROFILE=shared switches the log to hashed arguments.
.claude/mcp-token-log*.jsonl
.claude/mcp-cache-snapshot*.jsonl
